@startuml
actor Frontend as FE
participant "CollectController" as Controller
participant "CollectService" as Service

FE -> Controller: 发起收藏请求
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 检查用户登录状态
Controller -> Controller: 记录收藏日志
Controller -> Service: 查询用户是否已收藏
activate Service

Service --> Controller: 返回收藏状态
Controller -> Service: 调用save方法保存收藏记录
Service --> Controller: 返回保存结果
Controller --> FE: 返回收藏结果
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
@enduml
